1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,500
When a crop develops a problem, a farmer needs guidance they can understand.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:15,300
But typing long questions, navigating complicated screens, or searching through
English-only information can make digital tools difficult to use.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,000
For many farmers, speaking feels simpler.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Meet Krishi Mitra, a Kannada-first agricultural voice assistant.

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:31,500
The goal is simple: let farmers ask naturally, receive clear general guidance,
and listen to the answer in their preferred language.

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,000
It is a mobile-friendly web app, not a native phone app.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Here is the actual application. A farmer opens the app, selects Kannada or English,
and taps the microphone.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Gnani AI converts speech into text. The transcript stays visible, so the farmer
can check or edit it before submitting the question.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Groq generates general guidance, and Gnani AI reads it aloud.
Listen to this Kannada example.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:11,000
[EDITING PLACEHOLDER: INSERT VERIFIED ENGLISH TRANSLATION OF THE ACTUAL KANNADA APP AUDIO.]

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,700
The interface is simple: one question box, a microphone, and Listen.

12
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:25,000
Example questions fill the box without submitting.

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,000
PWA support offers an app-like web experience. A separate guided mode focuses on
paddy, arecanut, and coconut.

14
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,500
Krishi Mitra provides general guidance, not a confirmed diagnosis.

15
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:48,000
Unclear or serious problems should be checked with a local agriculture officer.
The browser app is our demonstration; telephone integration remains incomplete.

16
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,200
Krishi Mitra brings together voice input, agricultural assistance, and spoken answers,
making digital guidance easier to access.

17
00:01:54,200 --> 00:02:00,000
Built for the Gnani AI Great Indian AI Internship Challenge.
